说他最近他最近待的有个群被封了 https://t.co/h7L5SQ2kT4","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114569846298198351"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114555741621334016"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T03:13:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114555118935027985","2114555871644745734"],"id":"2114555871644745734","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":775,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114504726691856632","type":"quoted"}],"text":"哈哈,  价值 1599$ 的技术峰会,  现在不用花钱就能了解硅谷AI峰会的顶级洞察了 https://t.co/IU48aUSCiD https://t.co/XFmVoeEs3m","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114555871644745734"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114538578344923136"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T02:06:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114539221973365233"],"id":"2114539221973365233","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":5781,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2103300004966478284","type":"quoted"}],"text":"🚨🚨🚨 Muse 的大版本升级又冷不丁的来了  \n\n这回是 8.0 -&gt; 9.0 \n\n搜了半圈,  没发现 9.0 升级了个啥 \n\n顶级科技产品升级也这么不透明的嘛 https://t.co/p8EYZ7xv1D https://t.co/4dwpt0XDYn","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114539221973365233"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114534551938842781"],"id":"2114534551938842781","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":511,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114271904886567061","type":"quoted"}],"text":"可可老师搞活动了, 支持一下 https://t.co/Ae0zQff56X","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114534551938842781"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T00:54:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114520929351148032"],"id":"2114520929351148032","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":587,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114407583167705279","type":"quoted"}],"text":"好期待这样一款代理语言 \n\nRust 快是快,  就是编译太慢了\nGo 是设计空间小,  比 Rust 慢 \n\nBend 期待一下 https://t.co/dad5pX68Ed","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114520929351148032"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114393312132313088"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T16:28:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114393685597278329"],"id":"2114393685597278329","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":592,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113898167133712465","type":"quoted"}],"text":"哈哈,  这个提示词好玩.  \n\n我的房间出来了, 我只能说只有60% 的相似度 \n\n不过这个房间人机协作倒是挺合适的 https://t.co/Funy54PB7w https://t.co/WYyzcKRwJA","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114393685597278329"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T15:39:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114381226530472425"],"id":"2114381226530472425","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":38,"impression_count":3140,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114353320852865530","type":"quoted"}],"text":"上周有人发帖说 Grok Bot 云电脑回滚到 6～7 周前的旧快照（41 万浏览），几周工作全乱了。这篇花 20 分钟用开源的 Syncthing 配了一套单向实时备份，Bot 改完文件十几秒后 Mac 上就有，连误删都能从历史版本里捞回来。\n\n做法就三步：Mac 装好 Syncthing 拿到 Device ID；给 Grok Bot 发一条 https://t.co/AY3nixLPaK","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114381226530472425"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T14:59:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114371309723582569"],"id":"2114371309723582569","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1864,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114362244700266849","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Grok bot （0.77.0-pre.20 到 pre.26）里的 14 项改动。\n\n最实的几块：\n结账能直接选存好的卡或 X Money 付给商家；\nGrok Bot 拨电话前先弹审批卡，写明事由、代谁打和合规同意；\n订餐厅状态覆盖等位、留台和按人数确认，还能带 Yelp 评分；\n另外预埋了跑在客户私有 worker（带密钥同步）、共享 Bot https://t.co/UKYVLgn1A8","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114371309723582569"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2114342866453741568"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:51:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114354089610145909"],"id":"2114354089610145909","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":4255,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":2},"text":"卡兹克花 5 天、用掉 30% 的 Claude 周额度和两管 Codex 额度，把散在桌面定时、Webhook 后台 CLI、Dots 里的 Agent 自动化任务，做成了《戴森球计划》那种微缩景观流水线，平时挂个小屏幕就能当桌搭。\n\n片子里 14","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114354089610145909"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2114332567889649664"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T12:28:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114333365688320501"],"id":"2114333365688320501","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":45,"impression_count":8214,"like_count":45,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109544824135467312","type":"quoted"}],"text":"卧槽  ❗️❗️❗️ Rea 即将超越 Openclaw 了 , 只差 12 K Star 的差距了 \n\n超越 Openclaw 基本上是板上钉钉了 \n\n而且 Fork 数也快超过 100 K  了 ,   只能是超级爆款开源项目 \n\n现象级中的现象级啊啊啊啊 \n\nhttps://t.co/rcn3WKkLkt https://t.co/rfZAeM1x7M","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114333365688320501"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114321547779584000"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T11:45:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114322487211389379"],"id":"2114322487211389379","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":661,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"记得上次见到 V 神 ,  还是在 24年的泰国 ,  那时候的 Eth Devcon 真是盛况空前 https://t.co/S7zYI2c4W3","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114322487211389379"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T11:12:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114314064562442366","2114314271215763748"],"id":"2114314271215763748","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":1647,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113478290661163067","type":"quoted"}],"text":"这份小红书指南, 放到咸鱼去至少也得卖 199 吧\n\nhttps://t.co/rRXOfguTnE https://t.co/06KGMjaHxr","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114314271215763748"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T10:24:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114301945204682949"],"id":"2114301945204682949","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":1043,"like_count":7,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114289208793973231","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Kin 半个月创作者收益破 1000 美元，对应后台大约 81 万认证曝光。这篇把申请门槛、港卡、提现拆成 20 问讲清楚。\n\n门槛硬核就几条：开 Premium，至少 500 认证粉，近 90 天约 50 万自然曝光。曝光只算蓝 V 在首页时间线刷到你，回复和大 V 评论区刷出来的都不算门槛。 https://t.co/wPGPdIgP7C","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114301945204682949"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T09:54:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114294402189570539"],"id":"2114294402189570539","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":1046,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114120833807343618","type":"quoted"}],"text":"做了四年半代码审查工具的 Jacob Gold（原 Graphite，现 Cursor / SpaceXAI 做 Origin），现在劝人别再一行行审 PR。\n\n他盯的一直是同一段：PR 提出来到合进主干。2025 年他算过，动手到提 PR 的时间砍一半，团队大概快 10%；提 PR https://t.co/dG4xyF7HHr","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114294402189570539"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2114258069517729792"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T08:52:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114279020896350322"],"id":"2114279020896350322","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":349,"impression_count":24012,"like_count":349,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":43},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113195080517562646","type":"quoted"}],"text":"牛逼 ！！！ 今天去用了 Lemomo 开源的 Lemo-Opuscar 去做视频，顿时被震惊了。 3D 效果太好了。 仓库 GitHub 约 6.8k 星，这次从「挑风格做片」改成「自己搭风格库」。\n\n风格从 39 涨到 59，新加 8 种剪辑与纪实：字幕新闻、1920s https://t.co/pR74YYsBcq","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114279020896350322"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T08:35:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114274625618346446"],"id":"2114274625618346446","in_reply_to_user_id":"1759530111534243840","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":632,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114259038028652657","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"用的是这个开源仓库：\n\n- [lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar](https://t.co/r3j2v6NMSe)，Claude Code 视频 skill，Three.js 全 3D 影棚管线（HDRI、柔光箱、GTAO、物理景深）","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2